1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,710
(Sheldon:)-Sleep well, my friend.
-You too.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:05,500
(Sheldon:)Let me just get one thing.

3
00:00:06,255 --> 00:00:08,675
(Sheldon:)It's my backup emergency supply kit.

4
00:00:09,341 --> 00:00:11,971
The living-room escape route
doesn't pass through here.

5
00:00:12,136 --> 00:00:13,176
(Sheldon:)Now, good night.

6
00:00:13,345 --> 00:00:15,475
(Sheldon:)And if there's an apocalypse,
good luck.

7
00:00:18,934 --> 00:00:20,604
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,690
(Leonard:)Yes?

9
00:00:24,148 --> 00:00:26,858
(Elizabeth:)-I saw your light on.
-Is everything all right?

10
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:28,738
(Elizabeth:)Yeah, I just couldn't sleep.

11
00:00:29,278 --> 00:00:30,448
(Leonard:)Me neither.

12
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:32,443
(Leonard:)Look what I'm reading.

13
00:00:32,615 --> 00:00:34,035
(Leonard:)It's you.

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,530
(Elizabeth:)-I thought you already read it.
-I did.

15
00:00:36,702 --> 00:00:40,582
(Leonard:)But it's been a while, and I wanted
to sound smart over breakfast.

16
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,580
(Elizabeth:)Aw, you're smart.

17
00:00:42,791 --> 00:00:45,211
Oh, good. I wasn't sure
it was coming across.

18
00:00:46,378 --> 00:00:47,588
(Elizabeth:)What chapter are you on?

19
00:00:47,755 --> 00:00:49,215
(Leonard:)Uh, six.

20
00:00:49,381 --> 00:00:53,221
Ah. The extragalactic distance ladder.

21
00:00:53,552 --> 00:00:56,432
(Elizabeth:)-Want to know a little secret?
-Sure.

22
00:00:56,639 --> 00:01:02,019
(Elizabeth:)I wrote the section on the
Wilson-Bappu Effect completely naked.

